OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal rights group calls for ban
OL,4,Aat historical park
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnimal rights group Peta have called on
OL,7,Fa local authority to block any
OL,8,Fproposals for a planned theme park from
OL,9,Fincluding attractions and shows
OL,10,Ffeaturing animals.
OL,12,FA decision on French firm Puy du Fou's
OL,13,Fproposals to build the history-based
OL,14,Famusement park on land north of
OL,15,FBicester is set to be made by Cherwell
OL,16,FDistrict Council by the end of
OL,17,FNovember.
OL,19,FMore than 16,000 people have backed a
OL,20,FPeta petition urging the council to
OL,21,Freject any plans involving live animal
OL,22,Fexhibits or shows at the new park.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
