OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal rights group calls for ban
OL,4,Aat historical park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPuy du Fou said animals were often the
OL,7,F"stars of our shows" and that those
OL,8,Fhoused at the parks are looked after
OL,9,F"to the highest international
OL,10,Fstandard".
